  },
  {
   "d": "2024-04-22",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "We expect this momentum to continue over the rest of the year and, therefore, are targeting FY 24 revenue in the range of £104-110 million. After factoring in the impact of Insigniam's lower margins at acquisition, we expect our Adjusted EBITDA margin to be in the range of 27-29%.",
   "file": "20240422_ELIX_Final-Results.md"
  },
  {
